# --- Instance data: yours, never part of the framework ---------------------------------------
# Everything /start writes and everything the flow produces lives here and is ignored by default, so
# /upgrade can never collide with it. Want your registry and metrics versioned? Delete the lines you
# want tracked; the framework never adds files with these names.
/REPOS.md
/ROUTING.md
/workflow.conf
/METRICS.md
/plans/
/learnings/
/.worktrees/
/.claude/registry-checked
/.claude/settings.local.json

# Every top-level folder is one of your repositories, each its own git repository. The framework's
# own folders are listed back in below.
/*/
!/.claude/
!/docs/
!/templates/
!/tests/
# The coordinator's CLAUDE.md is framework, not instance data. Many machines ignore CLAUDE.md and
# .claude/ globally; this repo's own rules win over that, so both stay tracked in every clone.
!/CLAUDE.md

# --- Local noise ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
CLAUDE.local.md
